---

The software in this package starts a self-hosted Queuey on the machine it runs on. Queuey itself is not part of
this package: it runs from the container images queuey/server and queuey/console, which the package fetches with
Docker. Those images are not covered by the license above; they are licensed under Queuey's own terms, which come
with each installation's license file.
